e must also mention transformations: list of strings describing what we did.\n\nHypothesis: Combining SoA layout, max-heap selection with index tie-break, NEON vectorized distance computation, and direct frequency counting yields a fast exact KNN implementation without OpenMP overhead.\n\nNotes: We integrated A's heap/SoA, B's NEON, C's frequency counting; omitted OpenMP due to observed slowdown in prior experiments for this workload.\n\nNow write JSON."
